**Per-index metric identity** (this is the core useful lemma — "D_gradSq_second"):

```
lemma D2_gradSq_identity (dd) (d) (i) (u) :
    dd.D (m.basis i) (dd.D (m.basis i) (gradSq dd u))
        - dd.D (d.nabla (m.basis i) (m.basis i)) (gradSq dd u)
