Hmm wait, careful with signs: W = ⟨∇u,Δ∇u⟩ - ⟨∇u,∇Δu⟩. And W = DUpart + F's DU part + UUF where UUF = `∑_{j,i,k,l} u_j(-γ(i,k,j)γ(i,k,l) + γ(i,i,k)γ(k,j,l))u_l`. So W = DUraw + UUF. And DUraw = ½∑_{j,a,b,m} u_j K(j,a,b) c(a,b,m) u_m (the pairing). And ½∑K·c + UUF = RicUU (the coefficient identity). So W = RicUU ✓.

