```
lemma w_du_coeff_fixed_j (dd) (d) (u) (j : ι) :
    (∑ i, ∑ m, (cG d i j m * dd.D (m.basis i) (ui dd u m)
          - cG d j i m * dd.D (m.basis m) (ui dd u i)
          - gamma d i j m * dd.D (m.basis i) (ui dd u m)
          + gamma d i i m * dd.D (m.basis j) (ui dd u m)))
      + (∑ i, ∑ k, (gamma d i k j * dd.D (m.basis i) (ui dd u k)
          - gamma d i i k * dd.D (m.basis k) (ui dd u j)))
    = ∑ a, ∑ b, K d j a b * dd.D (m.basis a) (ui dd u b) := by
  unfold K
  -- decompose RHS into 6 pieces, and match each LHS piece by renaming
```

The RHS pieces after unfold K:
`∑_{a,b} (cG a j b - cG j b a - gamma a j b + gamma a b j + (if a=j then ∑i γ(i,i,b) else 0) - (if b=j then ∑i γ(i,i,a) else 0)) · D_a u_b`.

The δ-terms: `∑_{a,b} (if a=j then ∑_i γ(i,i,b) else 0)·D_a u_b = ∑_b (∑_i γ(i,i,b))·D_j u_b` — this matches LHS's `+∑_{i,m} γ(i,i,m)D_j u_m` (rename b↔m) ✓. And `-∑_{a,b} (if b=j then ∑_i γ(i,i,a) else 0)·D_a u_b = -∑_a (∑_i γ(i,i,a))·D_a u_j` — matches LHS's `-∑_{i,k} γ(i,i,k)D_k u_j` (rename a↔k) ✓.

So the lemma proof: expand RHS via Finset.sum_congr + the if-terms via `Finset.sum_eq_single`-style manipulation, then match pieces with the LHS by renaming. The pieces:

RHS = ∑_{a,b} cG a j b·D_a u_b [A1]
     - ∑_{a,b} cG j b a·D_a u_b [A2]
     - ∑_{a,b} gamma a j b·D_a u_b [A3]
     + ∑_{a,b} gamma a b j·D_a u_b [A4]
     + ∑_{b} (∑_i gamma i i b)·D_j u_b [A5]
     - ∑_{a} (∑_i gamma i i a)·D_a u_j [A6]

LHS = ∑_{i,m} cG i j m·D_i u_m [B1]
     - ∑_{i,m} cG j i m·D_m u_i [B2]
     - ∑_{i,m} gamma i j m·D_i u_m [B3]
     + ∑_{i,m} gamma i i m·D_j u_m [B4]
     + ∑_{i,k} gamma i k j·D_i u_k [B5]
     - ∑_{i,k} gamma i i k·D_k u_j [B6]

Matching: B1=A1 (i,m↔a,b), B2=A2 (m,i↔a,b), B3=A3, B4=A5, B5=A4 (i,k↔a,b), B6=A6 ✓.

