The core: `fieldInner (gradField dd u) (fieldLaplacian dd d u) = ∑_{j,i} u_j ((∇_i∇_i gu)_j - (∇_{∇_i e_i} gu)_j)` and `fieldInner (gradField dd u) (gradLapField dd d u) = ∑_{j,i} u_j D_j H_ii`. Then expand the (∇∇) terms via nablaField_nablaField_grad_H and nablaField_nabla_grad_H, and D_j H_ii via H_expand + map_sub/map_sum + Leibniz... 

