/-- The field `∇Δu` (gradient of the connection Laplacian), in frame coefficients. -/
def gradLapField (dd : DerivationData m b A) (d : LeviCivitaData m b) (u : A) : VecField A ι :=
  fun j => dd.D (m.basis j) (lap dd d u)
```

